From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:59:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix careers.html merge conflict, ease header spacing, extend
 navy band

- Resolved an unresolved git conflict marker that had been committed
  straight into the Careers hero (a leftover <<<<<<< HEAD / ======= /
  >>>>>>> block around the location badge, visible live on the page).
  Dropped that badge entirely, matching how the About page hero
  handles its own location badge.
- Header now has 32px of breathing room instead of sitting flush at
  the viewport edge (20px on narrow mobile) -- the earlier full-bleed
  change was too tight.
- "Find your specialty" now uses the same dark navy band as About's
  "How we work" (.section-band-navy), so the two blue-band sections
  read consistently across pages.
- Removed "Penang" from Careers marketing copy (meta description,
  hero lede, hero badge) and softened each job listing's location
  from "Penang, Malaysia" to "Malaysia", consistent with the earlier
  direction to stop foregrounding one location. Left the literal
  office address in the footer untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
